    <title>Fuel :: Injector size scaler K (global pulse multiplier)</title>
    <description>CURATED (code-proven): Global injector size/quantity scaler. FUN_0004E5FA sets final injector time = deadtime + base_time*(K-400)/200 (K = this value) then saturates to 0..65535. Effective multiplier = (K-400)/200 (e.g. 600 = x1.00, 620 = x1.10, 400 = x0). Raise to richen ALL cylinders (primary and secondary) proportionally, lower to lean. Stock 600 (u16 0..65535).</description>
